    description: 'Materials, labor & room size factors. What crown molding installation actually costs in Central Florida.',
    icon: '📐'
  },
  {
    href: '/guides/exterior-paint-colors-florida-sun',
    title: 'Exterior Paint Colors for Florida Sun & Mildew',
    description: 'Best colors for Florida homes. UV resistance, mildew control, heat reflection. What works in Kissimmee & Orlando.',
    icon: '🌞'
  },
  {
    href: '/guides/pool-deck-power-washing-kissimmee',
    title: 'Pool Deck & Patio Power Washing in Kissimmee',
    description: 'Remove algae, mold & slippery grime from pool decks. Concrete, pavers, travertine. Safe & effective cleaning.',
    icon: '💦'
